==Battleground==
*2 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 16.67~23.33 seconds<sup>500f~700f</sup>.
*1 [[Mistress Celeboodle]] spawns after 16.67 seconds<sup>500f</sup>.
*1 [[Corporal Weyland]] spawns after 36.67 seconds<sup>1,100f</sup>.
*When the base reaches 99% HP:
**1 [[Commander Ostromeda]] spawns as the boss.
**2 [[Axoloty|Axoloties]] spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**2 [[Shachiko]]s spawn after 6.67 seconds<sup>200f</sup>, delay 33.33~40 seconds<sup>1,000f~1,200f</sup>.
**30 [[Haniwanwan]]s spawn after 10 seconds<sup>300f</sup>, delay 53.33~60 seconds<sup>1,600f~1,800f</sup>.
**1 [[Corporal Weyland]] spawns after 33.33 seconds<sup>1,000f</sup>.
**2 [[Mistress Celeboodle]]s spawn after 40 seconds<sup>1,200f</sup>, delay 66.67~73.33 seconds<sup>2,000f~2,200f</sup>.

==Strategy==
Not particularly challenging. Use [[Hip Hop Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Can Can Cat]] for the start-off, and [[Talents|Talented]] [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Awakened Bahamut Cat]] to hit the enemy base and score significant damage to Commander Ostromeda. Then, lure Ostromeda near your base and finish it off with ranged options like [[Master of Logic Newtone (Special Cat)|Newtone]], [[Master Uril (Special Cat)|Esoteric Uril]], [[Master of Life Dr. Nova (Special Cat)|Dr. Nova]] and/or [[Bakery Cat (Rare Cat)|Fried Chicken Cat]]. [[Idi:N (Special Cat)|Idi:NX]] is recommended to help deal with the Shachikos whenever you get an opening, and [[Kotatsu Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Octopus Cat]] is also recommended to help with Haniwanwan or a stray Axoloty Wave. The stage dissolves into [[Cossack Cat (Rare Cat)|Royal Guard Cat]] spam once Ostromeda is down.

==Trivia==
*Bridge of Forgotten Sporks' Japanese name, Wasurerareta Hashi (忘れられた橋, "Forgotten Bridge"), plays off of how 橋 (bridge) and 箸 (chopstick) are both read as ''hashi''. Chopsticks can be used to eat the food in a ''[[wikipedia:Bento|bento]]'', the theme of [[Bento Region]].

